    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "An early Arthur C. Clarke novel that takes place on the Moon.  The setting is a future in which the Moon has become a tourist destination, and one of the attractions is a huge dust bowl on which one can sightsee from a \"dust cruiser\".  Then there's a serious accident......  This is an excellent hard SF adventure."
